'''Gary's Shack''' is a [[Location]] on {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

{{ZoneText|Talk to Gary.|Admire his snow machine.}}

== Purpose ==
{{NPCSprite|Gary}} is an [[NPC]] located inside '''Gary's Shack'''. They grant dialogue under different conditions, and when {{zone|Jerry's Workshop}} is under attack and has already lost enough [[Gifts]], {{NPCSprite|Gary}} will power his snow cannon, and will shoot at the {{NPCSprite|Magma Cube}}s.

